<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n2181" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴγλη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the light of the sun</i> or
				<i>moon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.45
			</span></i>, etc.:—of the radiance of Olympus, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκὴ αἴ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				6.45
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				610
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς αἴγλαν
			μολεῖν</span> to come to <i>daylight</i>, i.e. to be born,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>N.</u>
				1.35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φοιβὰν ὑπαὶ χειμῶνος
			αἴ.</span>, of <i>sunshine</i> on edge of storm-cloud, <i><span class="en">
				B.
				12.140
			</span></i>; of <i>dream light</i> in sleep, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				831
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			generally, <i>radiance, gleam</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ
				χαλκοῦ αἴ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.458
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πυρφόρους Ἀρτέμιδος
			αἴ</span>. the <i>gleam</i> of her torches, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				207
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέλαιναν αἴ.</span>, of
			dying embers, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				549
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			metaph., <i>splendour, glory</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴ.
				ποδῶν</span>, of swiftness, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				13.36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διόσδοτος αἴ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>P.</u>
				8.96
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of shining
			objects, as a <i>bracelet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				594
			</span></i>; <i>fetter</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Epich.
				20
			</span></i>.</div>
